# Force the canonical .html URL for every page. Netlify's default clean-URL
# behavior otherwise serves the extensionless path (e.g. /contact) as a silent
# 200 duplicate of the canonical /contact.html, with no redirect either way —
# this makes the extensionless path 301 into the canonical, indexed .html URL
# instead. The homepage (/, /de/, /fr/) is intentionally left alone: it's
# already canonicalized to the directory form, not index.html.

